<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">31</span>兆<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">8,660</span>億元，上櫃公司營收為<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2</span>兆<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1,431</span>億元，雙雙創下「近十年次高紀錄」。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">金管會並點名，上市公司去年有三大產業獲利成長、表現出色，包括：金融保險業、水泥工業及電機機械業，上櫃公司也有三大產業包括：光電業、半導體業及電子商務業。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">金管會證期局表示，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2019</span>年上市營收金額為近<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">10</span>年次高，不過，因前年為近<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">10</span>年最高，基期墊高，故較前年減少<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2,134</span>億元，減少<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">0.67%</span>、</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">上市公司去年稅前淨利為<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2</span>兆<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3,032</span>億元，獲利金額居近<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">10</span>年第<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3</span>高，亦因前年基期較高，故較前年減少<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2,778</span>億元，減少<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">10.76%</span>。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">證期局指出，去年度上市公司獲利成長包括：金融保險業因淨利息收益、保費收入增加及匯率避險操作得宜而推升獲利；電機機械業因部分公司之虧損子公司停止營運，致集團虧損減少；水泥工業則因需求及價格皆大幅成長而增加獲利。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">其次，上櫃公司去年度累計營收<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2</span>兆<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1,431</span>億元，營收金額為近<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">10</span>年次高，惟因前年為近<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">10</span>年最高，基期墊高，故較前年減少<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">294</span>億元，減少<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1.35%</span>。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\